sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Admission Webhook<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant Operator as KubeRay Operator<br/>controller-runtime
    participant AuthCtrl as Authentication<br/>Controller
    participant MTLSCtrl as mTLS Controller
    participant NetPolCtrl as NetworkPolicy<br/>Controller
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant Head as Ray Head Pod<br/>(+ kube-rbac-proxy :8443)
    participant Worker as Ray Worker Pods
    participant Gateway as Gateway API<br/>HTTPRoute
    participant OSConfig as OpenShift<br/>APIServer Config

    Note over Operator,OSConfig: Startup: TLS Profile Alignment
    Operator->>OSConfig: GET config.openshift.io/v1/APIServer
    OSConfig-->>Operator: TLS security profile<br/>(cipher suites, min TLS version)
    Note over Operator: Configure serving TLS<br/>to match platform policy

    Note over User,Gateway: Flow 1: RayCluster Creation
    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply -f raycluster.yaml
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-ray-io-v1-raycluster<br/>Admission review
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated RayCluster
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-ray-io-v1-raycluster<br/>Admission review
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validated ✓
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Watch event: RayCluster ADDED

    Note over Operator,Worker: Reconciliation
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceAccount, Services
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Ray Head Pod
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Ray Worker Pods
    K8sAPI-->>Head: Pod scheduled
    K8sAPI-->>Worker: Pods scheduled

    Note over AuthCtrl,Gateway: Flow 2: Authentication Setup (OpenShift)
    AuthCtrl->>K8sAPI: Patch Head Pod: inject<br/>kube-rbac-proxy sidecar (:8443)
    AuthCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute in platform NS<br/>(cross-namespace to Ray head Service)
    AuthCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ReferenceGrant<br/>(authorize cross-NS routing)
    AuthCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create OpenShift Route<br/>(dashboard access)

    Note over MTLSCtrl,CertMgr: Flow 3: mTLS Provisioning
    MTLSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create cert-manager Issuer<br/>(per RayCluster)
    MTLSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create cert-manager Certificate<br/>(per RayCluster)
    CertMgr-->>K8sAPI: Issue TLS certificates → Secret
    MTLSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Mount TLS Secret into<br/>Head + Worker Pods
    Head->>Worker: Ray communication<br/>mTLS encrypted

    Note over NetPolCtrl: Flow 4: Network Policy
    NetPolCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy<br/>(restrict intra-cluster traffic)

    Note over User,Head: Flow 5: Dashboard Access
    User->>Gateway: HTTPS request to Ray Dashboard
    Gateway->>Head: Route via HTTPRoute<br/>to kube-rbac-proxy :8443
    Head-->>User: OIDC-authenticated<br/>dashboard response
